		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Week 01: Practice Immanent Critique\n\nCourse opening: research-creation as methodology. What does it mean to think *with* tools, not just *through* them? How do we inhabit our complicity and make it turn?","x":-400,"y":-1320,"width":680,"height":200,"color":"1"},
